# Poetry
.poetry/
poetry.lock # Add if generated by `poetry lock` and not meant to be committed by policy (though often it is)
# However, the instructions said "placeholder—let Poetry generate", which implies it might be committed after generation.
# For now, I will not ignore it, as it's typical to commit poetry.lock.
# If the user wishes poetry.lock to be generated by CI/users rather than committed, this can be uncommented.
# poetry.lock

