# Data files (if large or numerous, they shouldn't be in git)
# Add specific patterns for generated data if needed
# data/processed/*.parquet
# data/processed/*.png
# This is commented out as the .gitkeep implies the directory structure is tracked.
# Individual large files should be gitignored if they are not meant to be in the repo.
# For this project, the generated parquet files are small for demo purposes.
# If they become large, uncomment the lines above or add more specific rules.

